height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-money\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-x-large-font-size\">Financing Options</h1>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group my-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We understand the vast array of financial circumstances our customers find themselves in and are proud to offer financing options to keep your home comfortable today and for years to come.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"horizon-text full-width-mobile has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Speak with an expert</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(336) 281-9025</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"text-center has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same day appointments available by phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A Happy Home Services employee speaking on the phone with a customer\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer.jpg 1916w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer-1536x1026.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div id=\"available-plans\" class=\"wp-block-group container pb-5 flow has-secondary-inverse-color has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-3\">\n<div style=\"height:1rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer d-block d-md-none\"></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Available Plans for Heating, Cooling, and Indoor Air Quality Services</h2>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div  class=\"card card--page has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/heating-services-financing-options\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"427\" src=\"/images/2024/11/img-heat-pump-rev.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/images/2024/11/img-heat-pump-rev.png 600w, /images/2024/11/img-heat-pump-rev-300x214.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Heating Finance Options\" aria-label=\"Heating Finance Options\">Heating Finance Options</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><p>At Happy Home Services, we know that investing in a new heating system is a big decision. That’s why we offer <strong>flexible financing options</strong> for heating installations and replacements. Whether you’re upgrading to an energy-efficient system or replacing an outdated unit, our plans are designed to make the process seamless and affordable. Stay warm and comfortable today with a system tailored to your needs. Contact us to learn more about our financing options.</p>\n</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/heating-services-financing-options\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-heating\" /></svg><span >Heating Finance Options</span>\n\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div  class=\"card card--page has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/flexible-financing-plans-for-cooling-services\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"359\" src=\"/images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-1024x574.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"An exterior of a building with multiple AC units and flowers at a customer&#039;s house in Durham, NC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-1024x574.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-300x168.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-768x430.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-1536x861.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-2048x1148.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Cooling Finance Options\" aria-label=\"Cooling Finance Options\">Cooling Finance Options</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"b5979a3a-c1b1-47e3-9411-c35cc94e09e7\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\n<p>At Happy Home Services, we know that upgrading your cooling system is a big decision. That’s why we offer <strong>flexible financing options</strong> for cooling installations and replacements. Whether you’re investing in an energy-efficient air conditioner or replacing an older unit, our plans are designed to make the process seamless and affordable. Stay cool and comfortable today with a system tailored to your needs. Contact us to learn more about our financing options.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/flexible-financing-plans-for-cooling-services\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-cooling\" /></svg><span >Cooling Finance Options</span>\n\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div  class=\"card card--page has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/indoor-air-quality-services-financing-options\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"/images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Indoor Air Filter System that improves the indoor air quality of a residential customer&#039;s home.\" srcset=\"/images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Indoor Air Quality Finance Options\" aria-label=\"Indoor Air Quality Finance Options\">Indoor Air Quality Finance Options</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"4338e222-4c96-4150-b4ab-432bfcedb847\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\n<p>At Happy Home Services, we know that improving indoor air quality is a big decision. That’s why we offer <strong>flexible financing options</strong> for IAQ products and services. Whether you’re upgrading an air purifier, adding a humidifier, or replacing old equipment, our plans are designed to make the process seamless and affordable. Breathe easier with solutions tailored to your needs. Contact us to learn more about our financing options.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/indoor-air-quality-services-financing-options\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-indoor-air-quality\" /></svg><span >Indoor Air Quality Finance Options</span>\n\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n        <div id=\"google-reviews\" class=\"google-reviews-featured container container py-5 has-background has-gray-light-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head\">\n        <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo\">            <svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewBox=\"0 0 107.3 35.2\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 107.3 35.2;\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><title>Google</title><path fill=\"#4885ED\" d=\"M26.4,12.4H13.9v3.7h8.9c-0.4,5.2-4.8,7.4-8.9,7.4c-5.4,0-9.8-4.3-9.8-9.7c0-0.1,0-0.1,0-0.2 c0-5.6,4.4-10,9.8-10c4.2,0,6.7,2.7,6.7,2.7l2.6-2.7c0,0-3.3-3.7-9.4-3.7C6,0,0,6.5,0,13.6c0,6.9,5.6,13.7,14,13.7 c7.3,0,12.7-5,12.7-12.4C26