5/5\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__number-of-reviews\">\n                <span>18 Reviews</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n        <!-- reviews body -->\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__body\">\n                                                <!-- review carousel -->\n                <div class=\"nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--uniform-height\">                    <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Jan Minchew\" aria-label=\"Jan Minchew\">Jan Minchew</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>We have been using Happy Home for quite a few years and are always pleased with the professionalism and thorough work. The techs arrive on time and recently caught a major issue that we were unaware of. Thankfully it was still under warranty and it was repaired quickly.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Eric Lindsay\" aria-label=\"Eric Lindsay\">Eric Lindsay</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Great staff and technicians. Was confused on the pricing and they took time to take my call to explain the cost structure. After doing some research, they’re reasonably priced compared to others in the area when in need of a home visit to diagnose an HVAC issue. The technician was easy to work with and helped make sense of things. Would definitely recommend.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Chris Coates\" aria-label=\"Chris Coates\">Chris Coates</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Had a leaking valve and stripped connector to my faucet. Came out and was done quickly and efficiently. Charge was very acceptable, especially as I was in a bind – they came out next day to fix. Great service and the second time I&#8217;ve used them. Thanks again.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n            </div>\n    <!-- ./ review carousel -->\n    <div class=\"nearu-carousel-controls\">\n\t<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-prev\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n\t<div class=\"carousel-dots\"><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"1\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot selected\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"2\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"3\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-next\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- ./ reviews body -->\n\n</div>\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-972 -->"
